WEBVTT

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:04.230
You will not stand in our way any longer!

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:05.300
What is this?!

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.840
<b>Seton Academy Record 12       The Animal Students I Know</b>

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.940
Impossible! An animal that can 
speak directly into our minds?!

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:10.860
<i>It is possible...</i>

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:12.700
<i>for elephant species.</i>

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:16.810
<i>Modern elephants are widely known 
as the largest land mammal.</i>

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:19.200
<i>They can use low-frequency sound waves</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.030
<i>to communicate with other 
elephants ten kilometers away,</i>

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:26.290
<i>and they can even hear the sound of 
rain from forty kilometers away.</i>

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:30.000
<i>And a well-known extinct member 
of the elephant family is...</i>

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:33.970
<i>The woolly mammoth!</i>

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:37.910
<i>Everyone is familiar with 
these massive beasts</i>

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:39.970
<i>that ruled the land for four million years.</i>

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.270
<i>At least, that's the popular image of them...</i>

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:48.960
<i>But woolly mammoths were actually quite small.</i>

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:52.900
I'm the boss of Team EX, Koorimoto Man!

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:52.900
<b>* Modern African elephants are larger</b>

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:55.370
You looked a lot bigger before.

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:56.570
You're tiny.

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:58.280
Don't call me tiny!

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:01.050
After I made such an impressive entrance...

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.760
Your intimidating air created the 
illusion that you were bigger.

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:07.690
Now, An, knock them out and 
capture the humans at once!

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:13.810
Stop this, An! That's an order from your boss!

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:14.550
Wrong!

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:17.380
You fool.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:19.430
I am An's boss!

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:21.090
Y-You're wrong!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:22.770
She's not wrong.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:26.520
Unfortunately for you, my boss is none other

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:28.520
than Koorimoto Man.

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:31.480
Dumb dog!

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:32.730
Jin!

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:34.550
Dumb dog, where's Hitomi-chan?

00:01:34.550 --> 00:01:36.030
Over there!

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:37.500
Hitomi-chan!

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:40.620
Stop this, An!

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:42.580
Anetani-san, it can't be...

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:45.330
Why didn't I realize it before?

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:46.580
Red hair...

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:47.830
Blue eyes...

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:49.080
White skin!

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:51.030
I can't believe it!

00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:54.050
Anetani-san is a Neanderthal!

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:55.930
Neanderthals

00:01:55.930 --> 00:01:59.490
went extinct after losing in the power 
struggle against modern humans.

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:02.560
They were said to have red hair and pale skin.

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:05.600
That mammoth ordered An to...

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:08.730
What mammoth?

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:09.820
I'm right here!

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:10.870
You're tiny!

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:13.150
<b>* There were also some larger mammoths</b>

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:13.150
I told you not to call me tiny!

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:14.570
How dare you mock me?!

00:02:15.050 --> 00:02:18.780
I will eliminate all of you myself!

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:24.450
Stop. With that tiny body, 
you'll only hurt yourse—

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:25.930
Wh-What?!

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:26.950
Kin-kun?!

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:26.950
King?!

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:26.950
Stupid lion?!

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:28.700
Damn you!

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:34.170
Kin-kun!

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:34.170
Yena!

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:37.390
Don't think you can just 
touch me, foolish modern species.

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:41.550
Prepare to die, modern species!

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:44.100
<i>Damn it! What do I do?</i>

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:44.560
Stop!

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:47.430
If you want Jin, you'll have to fight me!

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:49.810
Stand aside. I have no business with you.

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:52.480
I'm Jin and Hitomi's boss! 
I will protect them!

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:55.040
Don't! You saw how ridiculously 
strong she is!

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:57.110
I wouldn't be a boss if I didn't fight now!

00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:00.090
<i>But the way this is going, 
she's guaranteed to lose.</i>

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:01.990
<i>Isn't there something... something...</i>

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:02.820
<i>That's it!</i>

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:04.150
Here I come!

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:07.490
Hey, stupid mini-mammoth!

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:09.690
Who are you calling a stupid mini?!

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:11.210
Let's settle this there!

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:13.220
A boxing...

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:14.210
...ring?!

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:16.500
If you can beat the dumb dog at boxing,

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.380
you can do what you want with me.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:20.970
But if you lose, you have 
to give Hitomi-chan back!

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:22.260
You fool!

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:25.850
Why would I accept such a 
proposal from a modern species?

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:29.880
All right, then.

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:31.210
Hey, impala!

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:33.430
I'm taking these!

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:42.820
Wh-What is this?!

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:45.100
Jin, what's going on?

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:47.490
Elephants hate any type of injury to their feet.

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:50.540
Even if it's just a marble 
or a ping pong ball,

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.670
they won't step on it.

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:56.580
Which means if they're all over 
the ground, she can't move!

00:03:56.590 --> 00:04:01.430
D-D-D... Damn it! Curse you, human!

00:04:02.030 --> 00:04:04.430
Serves you right, you stupid mini-mammoth!

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:08.030
I have plenty more marbles 
ready and waiting.

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:11.470
What do you say now?! Accept my proposal!

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:16.480
He's evil.

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:19.110
L-Like I would ever accept such a proposal!

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:21.690
I think we should go along 
with what they say.

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.370
We do have a hostage.

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:25.630
We'll be the ones to win in the end.

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:27.830
Hmph. Very well.

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:29.080
In that case...

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:33.080
I will destroy you under the 
conditions you've proposed!

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.500
Bring it on!

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:44.130
<b>Seton Academy vs Darwin Academy  Boxing Match</b>

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:51.270
Wh-Why do I have to be the referee?

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:52.640
<b>* Because she's a zebra</b>

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:52.640
Kuroe-san!

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:53.540
You look great!

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:55.640
<b>Commentator 
Donkey</b>

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:55.640
<b>Analyst 
Donkey</b>

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:55.640
<b>Guest 
Student Council President 
Hadano</b>

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:55.100
You've got this!

00:04:55.990 --> 00:04:58.810
Since when have we had relations 
with other schools?

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:00.400
Cooking club...

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:03.400
Truly, you know no limits!

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:10.410
<b>Go For It 
\h\h\h\h\hRanka!</b>

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:10.410
<b>Certain Victory</b>

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:10.410
<b>Prayers for Victory</b>

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:10.410
<b>Ranka Fan Club</b>

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:08.350
I jumped to the idea of boxing 
because she seemed slow,

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:10.410
but frankly, we won't know until it starts.

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:14.150
Are you sure about this? We can call it off.

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:16.300
No matter how strong the enemy is,

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:18.290
I'll face them if it'll protect my packmates.

00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:20.420
That's what a boss does.

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:24.090
Then start by confusing her with your speed!

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:24.880
Got it?

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:27.130
Got it!

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:30.590
Um, are you sure we can't 
just talk this over?

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:34.600
I told you. You're the ones 
who started this war.

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:37.390
But that was thousands of years ago...

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:39.480
No matter what you say,

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:41.190
our minds will not change!

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:42.860
But...

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:43.900
That aside...

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:47.470
Why are we dressed like this?

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:50.820
These were the kangaroos' conditions 
for borrowing their ring.

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:51.760
It's fine, it's fine!

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:53.550
Stop that!

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:54.330
<i>Right...</i>

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:57.160
<i>Ever since that day...</i>

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:58.580
Man, I'm starved.

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:00.330
Let's hit up the cafeteria.

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:05.340
Stare...

00:06:24.790 --> 00:06:25.630
Hey.

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:31.210
You're a Neanderthal, right?

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:32.450
That's right.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:35.260
Why did your kind go extinct?

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:38.740
We lost to humans in the struggle for survival.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:40.850
S-Same here! Same here!

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:43.750
Humans hunted down every last one of my kind!

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:43.750
<b>* There are other theories</b>

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:46.660
Humans need to just go extinct already!

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:48.590
Right.

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:52.140
I-I-I-I'm saying...

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:55.350
Would you like to help me 
make humans go extinct?

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:59.940
W-We can be friends who share the same goal!

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:02.860
Friends...

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:07.260
<i>After that, the two of us</i>

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:11.110
<i>gathered others who were 
like us and formed Team EX.</i>

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:15.200
All right! Watch me, An!

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:17.660
Time for the humans to go extinct!

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:25.840
Huh?

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:27.840
O-Onee-chan!

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:31.350
What do you intend to do if 
something happens to my sister?

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:32.940
She's up against a mammoth!

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:35.020
I'll fight her! Swap me in!

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:36.510
I won't let you!

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:37.970
Ranka...

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:41.600
I'll be the one to fight. 
Just stay there and watch.

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:45.940
She made her own decision 
to fight as our boss.

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:47.730
If you can relate to that kind of pride...

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:49.610
Then shut up and watch!

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:54.570
Onee-chan!

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:55.760
Ranka...

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:56.910
You can do this!

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:58.540
Let me out...

00:07:57.290 --> 00:07:58.540
Yeah!

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:07.670
An, I'll get this over with quickly.

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:10.010
Honestly, this is just so...

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.760
Fighters, step forward!

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:19.210
You will fight three rounds 
of three minutes each.

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:20.890
If one of you is rendered 
unable to fight,

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:22.170
I won't let you have Jin!

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:25.250
you have either until I count to ten

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:26.270
And because An betrayed me, 
her boss, I'll punish her!

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:29.330
or until your second throws in the 
towel before the match is called.

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:27.960
You're still saying that?

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:30.900
I told you, I'm her boss, 
you damned modern species!

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:33.570
We will now begin.

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:35.950
Round one, fight!

00:08:45.810 --> 00:08:47.960
Quit darting around so much!

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:56.370
Our brand-new ring!

00:08:56.370 --> 00:08:57.050
Captain!

00:08:58.230 --> 00:08:59.300
Crap!

00:09:04.170 --> 00:09:05.330
Dodge to the right, Ranka!

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:06.340
Duck between her legs!

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:07.730
Jump over her!

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:11.230
H-Huh?! What do I do?! What do I do?!

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:13.860
Anything! Just don't stand still, dumb dog!

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:14.820
Ow!

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:23.500
Round one is over!

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:25.410
Return to your corners!

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:27.940
You were saved by the bell.

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:32.830
Wobble, wobble...

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:37.680
Hey, you okay?

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:39.450
N-No problem!

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:42.670
So much force behind the slightest 
touch... She's scary.

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:43.680
But look.

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:45.530
She's tired.

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:48.500
My deduction that she lacked stamina was right.

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:51.880
I tire so quickly when 
I haven't been exercising enough.

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:54.440
I think it would be best not 
to chase her around blindly.

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:04.450
Everyone!

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.870
Cheer for Ranka, okay?

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:14.090
Hitomi, just look at you...

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:16.270
Hitomi-chan...

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:21.220
Hitomi...

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:23.850
I'm rooting for you, Ranka-chan.

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:26.930
Okay! Just wait! I'll win for sure!

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:31.400
I'll be fighting right by your side in spirit!

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:32.900
Good luck!

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:37.960
You're not scared?

00:10:37.960 --> 00:10:38.650
Huh?

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:41.860
You might end up captured for good.

00:10:43.190 --> 00:10:44.740
Of course I'm scared.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.370
And I really don't want them to do this at all.

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:50.850
After you and I had finally 
become friends...

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.140
Optimistic nonsense.

00:10:53.140 --> 00:10:56.170
Once you know the real me, 
you'll forget any of that happened.

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:56.630
Huh?

00:10:56.940 --> 00:10:58.710
I'm not a human.

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:00.510
I know.

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:03.260
You're a Neanderthal, right?

00:11:04.460 --> 00:11:07.070
Of course, I did think you 
were a human at first,

00:11:07.070 --> 00:11:09.750
but I got a little curious 
and looked into it.

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:10.940
Then why...

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:12.440
Because...

00:11:13.470 --> 00:11:15.480
What you are doesn't change anything.

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:17.980
You're still An-chan.

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:22.950
Hey! Try to hit me already!

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:25.750
Don't wanna!

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:29.330
Are you really a boss?

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:33.950
You've done nothing but run from 
me since this fight started.

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:37.170
Do you think anyone would follow you now?

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:40.090
A boss needs to be strong above all!

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:45.300
Well, I'm...

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:47.560
I'm a boss, too!

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:51.860
Hmph. In our eyes, you don't have 
what it takes to be a boss.

00:11:51.860 --> 00:11:53.100
Well, you're wrong!

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:56.190
Nope. You fail as a boss.

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:57.790
I'm still...

00:11:57.790 --> 00:12:00.320
I'm still a boss who can protect my packmates!

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:01.570
Don't, dumb dog!

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:02.450
Ranka-chan!

00:12:12.740 --> 00:12:13.460
One!

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:15.670
Two!

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:16.570
Three!

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:17.410
Ranka-chan...

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:18.450
Four!

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:19.630
I have to get up...

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:19.630
Five!

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:20.760
Six!

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:21.580
I have to get up!

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:22.470
Seven!

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:23.970
For Jin and Hitomi!

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:23.970
Eight!

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:25.130
Nine!

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:36.810
Return to your corners!

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:41.890
Boss, surely this is enough.

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:44.780
Don't be stupid! Nothing is over yet!

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:48.490
I think the modern species 
understand how we feel now.

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:50.240
There's no need to wipe them out.

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:55.120
This female said something 
to you, didn't she?

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:58.660
I believe I taught you that 
humans are mammals who lie.

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:04.620
That's enough, dumb dog!

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:06.370
Just let me handle things from here!

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:08.290
No! I'll never quit!

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:08.890
Look, damn it!

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:10.940
You need to worry about your own—

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:13.440
If you throw in that towel,

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:15.640
I'll never lick you again.

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:17.400
Dumb dog...

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:19.900
I promise I'll win!

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:23.400
Just for today, all right?

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:26.140
Jin?

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:34.200
There, there.

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:36.710
There, there. Good girl.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:38.960
Okay? Just one more round.

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:40.210
Go get her, Ranka!

00:13:46.580 --> 00:13:49.060
<i>The most basic way to train a dog</i>

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:51.180
<i>is with lots and lots of praise!</i>

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:03.400
<i>I have to protect Jin 
and Hitomi, no matter what.</i>

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:07.610
<i>I must do something before 
they win An over.</i>

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:16.710
<i>Now's my chance!</i>

00:14:17.860 --> 00:14:18.790
<i>Smirk.</i>

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:23.930
Don't underestimate us extinct species!

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:36.310
One!

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:37.500
Ranka-chan!

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:38.490
Two!

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:40.550
Three!

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:44.380
Ranka-san tried her hardest...

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:45.690
But now...

00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:47.940
Hang in there.

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.820
Ranka-chan, hang in there!

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:54.700
Hang in there!

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:56.950
Ranka! Hang in there!

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:02.960
Go for it! Go for it! Ranka!

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:04.840
Please stand up, Ranka-chan!

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:06.460
Go for it! Go for it! Ranka!

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:07.960
Get up, Ranka!

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:10.050
Nine, te—

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:17.100
D-Damned modern species!

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:19.310
Die! Die!

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:23.140
Slip! Get back!

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:26.070
Boss!

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:29.040
That's enough! There's no 
reason for us to fight—

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:29.900
Quiet!

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:32.870
We are Team EX, a gathering of species

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:36.030
who share the same hatred for 
the humans who wiped us out!

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:41.140
We may be different species, 
but our anger ties us together!

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:43.330
Don't fall for the humans' drivel!

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:47.250
I'm not asking you to trust the humans!
 I'm asking you to trust <i>me</i>!

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:51.470
You only need to do as your boss 
tells you, and nothing more!

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:51.970
Man!

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:52.970
Silence!

00:15:54.630 --> 00:15:55.720
Then...

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:57.890
Then...

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:01.350
I'm leaving Team EX!

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:07.400
I-I'm... I'm not your friend anymore!

00:16:13.190 --> 00:16:15.490
Not... my friend?

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:18.660
If you can't trust your friends,

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:21.040
you fail as a boss!

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:25.580
I fail... as a boss?

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:33.540
One!

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:34.780
Two!

00:16:34.780 --> 00:16:35.800
Three!

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:36.970
Four!

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:38.100
Five!

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:39.220
Six!

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:40.560
Seven!

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:41.630
Eight!

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:42.430
Nine!

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:43.630
Ten!

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:47.810
Ranka-chan!

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:49.190
Ranka!

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:52.150
You did it!

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:56.380
Congratulations!

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:05.230
She hates me... An hates me...

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:06.670
An-chan!

00:17:08.390 --> 00:17:09.500
Hitomi...

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:12.500
Wh-What are you doing?

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:15.230
Don't worry. I'm just going 
to treat your wounds.

00:17:15.230 --> 00:17:17.500
Why? We tried to...

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:20.680
The fight's over now. There are 
no friends or enemies anymore.

00:17:22.210 --> 00:17:24.120
<i>She's a human,</i>

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:25.710
<i>but she's so kind...</i>

00:17:27.170 --> 00:17:29.680
I couldn't understand it at first, either.

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:32.380
But this is what humans are.

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:35.490
We only knew a small part of what they were.

00:17:36.710 --> 00:17:41.210
I see. So that's why you chose to 
be in a pack with this female.

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:43.930
That's...

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:45.160
No.

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:47.820
An, you betrayed me, your boss.

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:49.680
So I have to punish you.

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:52.630
As of today, I'm banishing 
you from my pack.

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:55.420
Hey, Anetani-san...

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:57.660
If the boss ran you out of the pack,

00:17:57.660 --> 00:18:00.570
you'll just have to find another 
pack that'll accept you.

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:08.730
An...

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:12.970
Man, I know what I said earlier...

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:16.150
But would you let me join your pack again?

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:21.330
B-But... we've already lost our means 
of revenge against the humans.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:23.490
There's no reason for Team 
EX to exist anymore...

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:25.070
Hey, stupid mini-mammoth.

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:29.710
You can make friends without 
having common enemies, you know.

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:32.250
You just have to want to be together!

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:34.340
That's what it means to be friends!

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:36.700
Is that true?

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:38.220
Yes.

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:42.510
You and I can continue to be together?

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:43.890
Yes.

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:47.100
You and I can still be friends?

00:18:47.510 --> 00:18:48.600
Yes!

00:18:56.180 --> 00:18:58.110
You bastards!

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:04.370
How dare you do that to our boss?! 
You modern bastards must pay!

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:07.300
Well played...

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:08.330
<b>Extinct</b>

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:11.040
Hey, dumb dog.

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:14.420
I think you looked just a 
little bit like a boss today.

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:16.960
Jin!

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:20.420
Thank you!

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:24.800
<i>You gave me a glimpse of 
something amazing today.</i>

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:28.650
<i>Thanks. I mean it.</i>

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:35.400
On that note...

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:38.540
As a sign of our reconciliation, 
let's cook together!

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:42.530
Hey! What's it feel like to go extinct?

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:43.820
Huh? Huh? Huh? Huh?

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:44.940
Don't be rude, Meimei-san!

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:45.910
Aw...

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:49.500
U-Um...

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:55.410
Are there any giant ground sloths... 
in the extinction department?

00:19:55.410 --> 00:19:57.140
Yeah, there's one!

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:00.630
He absolutely loves pokeweed!

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:02.850
But he's bad at climbing trees,
 and he's very slow...

00:20:02.850 --> 00:20:03.730
An-chan!

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:06.890
This is your first time 
cooking with us, isn't it?

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:08.260
Y-Yeah.

00:20:08.260 --> 00:20:10.430
Don't bother, human!

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:14.310
An chose us! No matter what you say now—

00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:41.010
<b>Cherish Our Rivers</b>

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:50.030
Let's eat!

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:12.540
Hitomi... I'm sorry.

00:21:12.990 --> 00:21:17.450
I lied to you all that time, then did
 something so awful to you...

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:19.250
Actually, I was the same way.

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:21.630
When I first came to this school,

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:25.590
I thought I'd never get 
along with other animals.

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:26.800
But...

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:30.760
Those two, Jin-kun and Ranka-chan, 
taught me something.

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:34.220
Even if we're different species, 
no matter what happened in the past,

00:21:34.220 --> 00:21:37.110
we can get past anything. 
It all depends on us.

00:21:38.070 --> 00:21:41.650
So I hope you'll always 
be my friend from now on,

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:42.810
An-chan!

00:21:44.230 --> 00:21:45.150
Sure.

00:21:45.540 --> 00:21:46.660
An-chan!

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:51.990
I guess that means you and I
 are friends too, huh?

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:55.000
Let's be good buddies from now on, An!

00:21:58.000 --> 00:21:59.630
Nice to know ya!

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:02.370
I know! The three of us should 
grab a meal sometime!

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:05.050
Bye-bye!

00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:07.710
Come see us again, all of you!

00:22:08.270 --> 00:22:10.230
We're all friends now!

00:22:11.770 --> 00:22:16.390
<i>This is a school for animals, where all
 sorts of animals live together.</i>

00:22:16.990 --> 00:22:20.580
<i>It is a sacred cage where, even amid 
constant battles between species,</i>

00:22:20.580 --> 00:22:24.910
<i>students learn the spirit 
of survival of the fittest</i>

00:22:24.910 --> 00:22:29.910
<i>and make friends of many different species.</i>

00:22:30.300 --> 00:22:31.410
<i>It is called...</i>

00:22:31.410 --> 00:22:33.740
<i>Seton Academy!</i>

00:22:32.300 --> 00:22:35.410
<b>Seton Academy</b>

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:35.410
<b>Join the Pack!</b>

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:35.410
<b>Seton Academy</b>

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:37.410
Hey, Jin.

00:22:37.810 --> 00:22:41.170
You were being pretty friendly 
with An and the others, too.

00:22:42.450 --> 00:22:46.130
I just see no point in griping at 
species that are already extinct.

00:22:47.860 --> 00:22:48.720
Still...

00:22:49.120 --> 00:22:53.140
It would suck if you guys got caught up 
in the stuff they said about humans,

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:54.850
so you'd better not ever go extinct.

00:22:55.550 --> 00:22:58.230
We humans will be more careful, too.

00:22:59.650 --> 00:23:01.990
Don't go extinct, any of you.

00:23:01.990 --> 00:23:03.770
I need you.

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:07.280
I want to be a mated couple with you!

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:10.030
J-J-J-J-J-Jin!

00:23:10.030 --> 00:23:12.370
Augh! This again?!

00:23:14.380 --> 00:23:15.780
Jin-dono...

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:21.040
King?!

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:21.040
Stupid lion?!

00:23:21.440 --> 00:23:22.330
He's hurt bad!

00:23:22.330 --> 00:23:24.790
What the heck happened to you? You're a lion!

00:23:24.790 --> 00:23:28.210
Th-They have arrived at last...

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:29.170
They?

00:23:29.170 --> 00:23:30.050
Who's "they"?

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:30.890
<i>Yes...</i>

00:23:30.890 --> 00:23:34.080
<i>A new threat has befallen 
Seton Academy.</i>

00:23:34.080 --> 00:23:35.380
<i>And that is...</i>

00:23:35.380 --> 00:23:37.980
<i>Fabre Academy!</i>
